      "id": "claim_0cca74cb3ec84675a580c21e30588ac7",
      "statement": "The MCP websocket-client assigns a unique actionUUID to each gated request and sets approvalRequest: true: requestSubmitForm, requestDownloadFile, and requestFetchResource build approval metadata via createApprovalRequestOptions, and requestPerformBatch's addBatchActionApprovalMetadata gives every batch action an actionUUID but sets approvalRequest: true only on submit_form items.",
