      "id": "claim_f426d740b0ad43ea85603bbc664f9bcb",
      "statement": "Approval metadata (actionUUID and approvalRequest) is threaded into the WebSocket envelope by createSubmitFormEnvelope (inside payload.action), and by createDownloadFileEnvelope and createFetchResourceEnvelope (at payload top level), emitting the fields only when present; protocol validation rejects empty actionUUID and non-boolean approvalRequest.",
