    {
      "id": "claim_459aac59f6d3431982356ec2d118cdea",
      "statement": "BrijioBackgroundController routes gated envelopes (perform_action submit_form, download_file, fetch_resource, and perform_batch containing a gated action) through ensureApprovedAction, the single chokepoint that no-ops for non-gated actions, requires a non-empty actionUUID and an approval adapter, resolves and re-checks the active origin, consults the in-memory session-grant set, prompts with a timer, and fails closed with approval_unavailable rather than bypassing approval.",
