    {
      "id": "claim_15bbaef5980749c580fd465ca74034e0",
      "statement": "Approval decisions produce structured outcomes that echo actionUUID: approve runs one action only, approve_session stores an in-memory grant keyed by origin and actionType, deny returns approval_denied, the timer returns approval_timeout after hiding the banner, a missing adapter/origin/actionUUID returns approval_unavailable, and an origin change after the decision returns approval_origin_changed.",
