    {
      "id": "claim_d41cec89887a4b6baa732bebc9e6c484",
      "statement": "The local MCP HTTP server derives the approval deadline as approvalTimeoutMs = max(1000, httpTimeoutMs - BRIJIO_APPROVAL_TIMEOUT_BUFFER_MS), with BRIJIO_MCP_HTTP_TIMEOUT_MS default 60000 and the buffer default 5000, yielding 55000; this value is threaded through page-context config and BrijioPageActionsConfig into the gated request helpers' timeoutMs and into the background controller's approvalTimeoutMs (fallback 55000).",
