      "id": "claim_00c39fdc13df49f882228463919892b7",
      "statement": "Approval state is in-memory only: session grants live in a Set on BrijioBackgroundController, are cleared on disconnect, and are never persisted to page localStorage, extension storage, or IndexedDB; AGENTS.md states the do-not-bypass invariant, and ensureApprovedAction fails closed with approval_unavailable when it cannot present a prompt rather than executing a gated action without approval.",
