      "id": "claim_4f31d05afc774a749b606b1213ad0eeb",
      "statement": "The ApprovalAdapter (getActiveOrigin, requestApproval, hideApproval) is implemented per platform: Chrome's createChromeApprovalAdapter and Safari's createSafariApprovalAdapter inject the content script and send show_brijio_approval (carrying actionUUID, actionType, origin, timeoutMs) to render the brijio-approval-banner with approve/approve_session/deny buttons, and send hide_brijio_approval keyed by actionUUID to remove it; an unparseable response defaults to deny.",
