    {
      "id": "claim_50153946eb954ff0aae2b9baea2d56da",
      "statement": "performApprovalAwareBatch executes actions in order one approval prompt at a time: non-gated actions and gated actions with a matching grant run without a prompt, denial records approval_denied per action and continues the batch, and an approval timeout records approval_timeout for the current action plus approval_timeout skipped entries for all remaining unexecuted actions, returning a partial batch_result so the agent can retry just those actions; continueOnError still applies to post-approval execution failures and page navigation still aborts remaining actions.",
